.archive.org/web/20160513042845/http://news.ltn.com.tw/news/world/paper/767184\">存檔</a>於2016-05-13）.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E8%94%AC%E6%9E%9C&amp;rft.atitle=%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B0%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6%EF%BC%9A%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A55%E8%94%AC%E6%9E%9C+%E6%A0%B9%E6%9C%AC%E4%B8%8D%E5%A4%A0&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fnews.ltn.com.tw%2Fnews%2Fworld%2Fpaper%2F767184&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal\" class=\"Z3988\"><span style=\"display:none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-4\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173179\" /><cite id=\"CITEREF2012\" class=\"citation web\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.livescience.com/33991-difference-fruits-vegetables.html\">What's the Difference Between a Fruit and a Vegetable?</a>. 2012-06-12 <span class=\"reference-accessdate\"> &#91;<span class=\"nowrap\">2016-04-27</span>&#93;</span>. （原始內容<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20160420224401/http://www.livescience.com/33991-difference-fruits-vegetables.html\">存檔</a>於2016-04-20）.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E8%94%AC%E6%9E%9C&amp;rft.btitle=What%27s+the+Difference+Between+a+Fruit+and+a+Vegetable%3F&amp;rft.date=2012-06-12&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.livescience.com%2F33991-difference-fruits-vegetables.html&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook\" class=\"Z3988\"><span style=\"display:none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%9F%8B%E6%87%89%E7%89%A9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"韋應物\">韋應物</a>《<a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%83%A1%E9%BD%8B%E9%9B%A8%E4%B8%AD%E8%88%87%E8%AB%B8%E6%9